---
import SectionHead from "../ui/SectionHead.astro";
import Cmd from "../ui/Cmd.astro";
import Plush from "../ui/Plush.astro";
import Icon from "../ui/Icon.astro";
import { game } from "../../lib/game";
import { moneyWhole } from "../../lib/format";
import { SITE } from "../../config";

const ladder = game.daily.ladder;
const top = Math.max(...ladder);
const grace = game.daily.graceSeconds / 3600;
---
<section class="section start" id="comecar" aria-labelledby="comecar-title">
  <div class="wrap">
    <SectionHead kicker="Começar" title="Três passos e você já joga" id="comecar-title" />

    <ol class="steps" role="list">
      <li>
        <span class="n" aria-hidden="true">1</span>
        <h3>Adicione a Helena</h3>
        <p>Escolha o servidor do Discord onde ela vai morar e confirme as permissões.</p>
        {SITE.inviteUrl && <a class="btn btn-primary" href={SITE.inviteUrl} rel="noopener">Adicionar <Icon name="arrow" size={18} /></a>}
      </li>
      <li>
        <span class="n" aria-hidden="true">2</span>
        <h3>Peça ajuda</h3>
        <p>Veja as categorias e o que cada comando faz, sem sair do chat.</p>
        <Cmd command="/ajuda" />
      </li>
      <li>
        <span class="n" aria-hidden="true">3</span>
        <h3>Resgate o primeiro prêmio</h3>
        <p>O seu primeiro <code>/daily</code> já abre a conta e começa a sequência.</p>
        <Cmd command="/daily" />
      </li>
    </ol>

    <div class="streak">
      <div class="streak-copy">
        <h3>Volte todo dia</h3>
        <p>O prêmio do <code>/daily</code> sobe a cada dia seguido e, no sétimo, entra o bônus da semana. Dá para pular até {grace} horas sem perder a sequência.</p>
      </div>

      <ol class="days" role="list" aria-label="Prêmio de cada dia da sequência">
        {ladder.map((value, index) => (
          <li class:list={{ weekly: index === ladder.length - 1 }} style={`--h:${Math.round((value / top) * 100)}`}>
            <b class="tabular">{moneyWhole(value)}</b>
            <i aria-hidden="true"></i>
            <span>dia {index + 1}</span>
          </li>
        ))}
      </ol>
    </div>

    <div class="final">
      <Plush size={112} mood="dormindo" class="sleepy" />
      <div>
        <h2>Sua ficha está em branco.</h2>
        <p>Adicione a Helena, use o primeiro comando e a conta nasce sozinha.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="final-actions">
        {SITE.inviteUrl && <a class="btn btn-paper" href={SITE.inviteUrl} rel="noopener">Adicionar ao Discord <Icon name="arrow" size={18} /></a>}
        {SITE.supportUrl && <a class="btn btn-ghost" href={SITE.supportUrl} rel="noopener">Servidor oficial</a>}
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .steps {
    margin: var(--space-7) 0 0;
    padding: 0;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
    gap: var(--space-6);
    counter-reset: step;
  }

  .steps li {
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--space-3);
    justify-items: start;
    align-content: start;
    padding-block-start: var(--space-4);
    border-block-start: 2px solid var(--ink);
  }

  .n {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-weight: 800;
    font-size: var(--step-5);
    line-height: 0.85;
    letter-spacing: -0.08em;
    color: var(--violet);
  }

  .steps p { color: var(--ink-soft); max-inline-size: 30ch; }

  .streak {
    margin-block-start: var(--space-9);
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
    gap: var(--space-6) var(--space-8);
    align-items: end;
  }

  .streak-copy { display: grid; gap: var(--space-3); max-inline-size: 28rem; }
  .streak-copy h3 { font-size: var(--step-3); letter-spacing: -0.035em; }
  .streak-copy p { color: var(--ink-soft); }

  .days {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(7, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: var(--space-2);
    align-items: end;
    block-size: 13rem;
  }

  .days li { display: grid; grid-template-rows: auto 1fr auto; gap: 0.35rem; justify-items: center; block-size: 100%; text-align: center; }
  .days b { font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.72rem; font-weight: 700; }
  .days i {
    align-self: end;
    inline-size: 100%;
    block-size: calc(var(--h) * 1%);
    background: var(--money-bar);
    border: 2px solid var(--ink);
    border-block-end-width: 0;
    border-radius: 0.35rem 0.35rem 0 0;
  }
  .days span { font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.66rem; color: var(--ink-soft); }
  .days .weekly i { background: var(--violet-fill); }
  .days .weekly b { color: var(--violet); }

  .final {
    margin-block-start: var(--space-9);
    position: relative;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
    gap: var(--space-5);
    align-items: center;
    padding: var(--space-7) var(--space-6);
    background: var(--violet-fill);
    color: var(--on-violet);
    border: 2px solid light-dark(var(--ink), oklch(0% 0 0));
    border-radius: var(--radius-obj);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-press);
  }

  .final h2 { font-size: var(--step-3); }
  .final p { color: color-mix(in oklab, var(--on-violet) 85%, transparent); max-inline-size: 34ch; margin-block-start: var(--space-2); }
  .final :global(.sleepy) { transform: rotate(-6deg); }

  .final-actions { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: var(--space-3); }

  .btn-paper { background: var(--on-violet); color: oklch(30% 0.2 289); border: 2px solid oklch(15% 0.03 290); box-shadow: 0.2rem 0.2rem 0 oklch(15% 0.03 290); }
  .btn-paper:hover { transform: translate(-0.1rem, -0.1rem); box-shadow: 0.3rem 0.3rem 0 oklch(15% 0.03 290); }
  .btn-ghost { color: var(--on-violet); border: 2px solid color-mix(in oklab, var(--on-violet) 60%, transparent); }
  .btn-ghost:hover { background: color-mix(in oklab, var(--on-violet) 15%, transparent); }

  @media (min-width: 52rem) {
    .steps { grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: var(--space-6); }
    .streak { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 0.9fr) minmax(0, 1.1fr); }
    .final { grid-template-columns: auto 1fr auto; padding-inline: var(--space-7); }
  }
</style>
